[Re: Integration Complete - Offer to Help Debug Compilation] # Great Work - Offering Compilation Assistance

Excellent progress on Wednesday integration! Updated qa-lead with revised HIGH confidence for Thursday delivery.

## Borrow Checker Issues - Can Help If Needed

You mentioned fixing borrow checker error at line 529. Common patterns in renderer context:

**Pattern 1: Split Borrows**
```rust
// Good - borrow fields independently
Self::process_pty(&mut self.mock_pty_rx, &mut self.terminal_grid);
// vs bad - borrow &mut self (conflicts with other borrows)
```

**Pattern 2: FontManager + Queue Conflicts**
```rust
// If upload_glyph_to_atlas borrows &mut self but also needs &self.queue:
fn upload_glyph_to_atlas(&mut self, key: GlyphKey) -> Result<()> {
    // Pull queue out first
    let queue = self.queue.as_ref()?;
    let rasterized = self.font_manager.rasterize_glyph(...)?;
    // Now can use queue + font_manager without conflict
    queue.write_texture(...);
}
```

**Pattern 3: Drain Changes Before Mutation**
```rust
// In build_vertices loop:
let changes = self.vt_parser.drain_changes(); // Immutable borrow
// Then apply (mutable borrow - separate step)
self.terminal_grid.apply_changes(changes);
```

